This repository is a production-oriented continuation of the original private
"chronos-with-autogluon" project by MostafaK66. The AutoGluon Chronos training,
train/test plotting, model persistence, and leaderboard behavior formed the
baseline for this restructuring.

The original repository did not contain a license file. The owner has added the
MIT License to this maintained version. AutoGluon, Chronos, Hugging Face model
weights, and other dependencies retain their respective licenses and are not
bundled with this repository.
